    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TrainGuard\n1. Arranca el bridge local: `python -m trainguard.bridge.app`\n2. Expón con ngrok: `ngrok http 8787`\n3. En el body del webhook puedes enviar:\n```json\n{\n  \"mode\": \"demo\",\n  \"kind\": \"nan_loss\",\n  \"bridge_base_url\": \"https://TU-URL.ngrok-free.app\"\n}\n```\nModes: `demo` | `analyze` | `inject`\nFaults: `nan_loss` | `exploding_lr` | `stall`",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420
      },
